      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This would be great! It's possible to configure the camera to be any resolution you like, but the UI doesn't respect aspect ratios other than 16:9 (in both live and open beta iterations) - it'd be great if this were possible, even if it just meant black bars on the camera UI",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-09-08T15:58:16.300Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Taking photos in VRChat is my new favourite hobby! :D An option to change the aspect ratio of the camera would be sweet, like 4:3, 16:9 and the standard would be a nice addition. And maybe even Square ratio, 3:2, 7:5 and 10:8. But that may be asking too much.\n\nIn other words I want to spend less time editing my shots after the fact when it comes to cropping photos. ;)",
